 "bug_found_by_self_review_and_fixed_before_the_freeze": "CAMPAIGN_PLACE_OBJECT_ID first bound campaign_object_host_id, which answers a hosted mobile's roster identity for any non-structure: every mobile insertion would have sent a NAME with the mobile's identity. mb_hostplace.c now answers only for structures (place_object_id). Found by reading the helper before the final run; the dialogue control binds its own CAMPAIGN_PLACE_OBJECT_ID and cannot catch a binding error in mb_hostplace.c, so this one is covered by review and the source guard's text assertions only (no C test of the real binding exists without an engine).",
